      '<div class="sx-actions"><button type="button" data-onboard="asp-inspect">Inspect origins</button><button type="button" data-onboard="asp-confirm">Confirm sources</button><button type="button" data-onboard="asp-revalidate">Simulate source change</button></div>',
      '<li><strong>01 List</strong><span>Regular tabs and files only.</span></li><li><strong>02 Selection</strong><span>Unchecked stays out.</span></li><li><strong>03 Confirm</strong><span>Revalidates origins before dispatch.</span></li>',
