      '<li><strong>01 Memory</strong><span>Model size vs measured availability.</span></li><li><strong>02 Workloads</strong><span>Calls and uploads protected.</span></li><li><strong>03 Unload</strong><span>Frees memory, keeps browsing.</span></li>',
