      '<div class="sx-actions"><button type="button" data-onboard="tpr-close">Keep until close</button><button type="button" data-onboard="tpr-timed">Set 2-hour expiry</button><button type="button" data-onboard="tpr-expire">Simulate expiry</button></div>',
      '<li><strong>01 Scope</strong><span>Tab and site visible.</span></li><li><strong>02 Duration</strong><span>Close or timed expiry.</span></li><li><strong>03 Limits</strong><span>Eviction restarts playback; uploads need evidence.</span></li>',
