      '<li><strong>01 Errors</strong><span>Offline, timeout, DNS, cert.</span></li><li><strong>02 Retry</strong><span>GET only, retained query.</span></li><li><strong>03 Safety</strong><span>No POST replay; no HTTP fallback.</span></li>',
