    'ad19-export':'Reward data exported for the account.',
    'ad19-exit':'Refused: exit does not confiscate already valid entitlements by default.',
    'ad20-verify':'Business verified; authorized advertiser roles assigned with the contract version recorded.',
    'ad20-live':'Refused: unverified advertisers cannot submit or serve live inventory.',
    'ad21-submit':'Brief validated: supported owned placement and rewarded-inventory disclosure confirmed.',
    'ad21-thirdparty':'Refused: unauthorized replacement placement rejected.',
